_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Gq2o0at0DYCdOwWeDGDHFA","review_id":"dKOQlwfmcDeIMZcavpTJlw","date":"2012-10-06T14:11:07","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9262738227844238,"text_excerpt":"I go here often. The prices are good. There's always live music, sometimes awesome, sometimes not so much. Mondays are my favorite. I don't do Karaoke, but can not help but love watching the train wreck unfold before me. Although, last time I went these two headbanger looking dudes got up on the stage. We were all waiting from something hard & loud, when \"Man of Constant Sorrow\" started playing. They KILLED it! Good times. Food isn't bad. It's bar food. Not to mention you can do your laundry while have a whiskey & a burger."},{"business_id":"Gq2o0at0DYCdOwWeDGDHFA","review_id":"JE5K6XP9NVCGD3YtNhQB5Q","date":"2018-01-16T21:53:07","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9246057271957397,"text_excerpt":"This is an interesting place. It has live music, fairly good food, great drinks and a bartender that is efficient and knows her drinks... and also a laundromat. So that you can do laundry while drinking and listening to music, I guess. Someone at another venue in New Orleans recommended this place, and my Uber driver seemed surprised that anyone would recommend this place. The great thing about Frenchmen street, however, is that you can see live music in almost all the local establishments, find good food and drinks everywhere. This may not be the most swanky venue on or near Frenchmen Street, but I had a good time here."},{"business_id":"Gq2o0at0DYCdOwWeDGDHFA","review_id":"A9pznkZcEZDw9rMlULwEEw","date":"2010-11-02T22:32:46","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9241122007369995,"text_excerpt":"Love this spot ;))) The drinks are cheap , no cover... right in the heart of the french quarter. Great place to meet other locals and really just fun. Live music early on and a great jukebox too. The new kind ;) Also, a laundry mat but I have heard you need to monitor your clothes so they don't get stolen. Makes sense.. you are in the quarter mind you. They have food too... as far as I can tell its 24hrs on the food too!!! Great spot for late night/ early morning drinks.... We went at 4:30 AM on a Saturday and it was still poppin."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Gq2o0at0DYCdOwWeDGDHFA","photo_id":"W22A9H6lttifT7vjTMk9Bg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/W22A9H6lttifT7vjTMk9Bg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9376224875450134},{"business_id":"Gq2o0at0DYCdOwWeDGDHFA","photo_id":"0fpEQ1-fYjnVX13eCs226A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/0fpEQ1-fYjnVX13eCs226A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9330201745033264},{"business_id":"Gq2o0at0DYCdOwWeDGDHFA","photo_id":"V_f0pem3_qutH_7-RySM0g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/V_f0pem3_qutH_7-RySM0g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9305210113525391},{"business_id":"Gq2o0at0DYCdOwWeDGDHFA","photo_id":"xG7ytpUSJPaB7iKJF4hYLA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/xG7ytpUSJPaB7iKJF4hYLA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.930259644985199},{"business_id":"Gq2o0at0DYCdO